            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Just to add to this, if you add a keybind to toggle the signs, and call `redraw` afterwards, the signs will show up consistently, no matter how many times you toggle\n\n```lua\nvim.keymap.set(\"n\", \"<C-d>\", function()\n  local MiniDiff = require(\"mini.diff\")\n  MiniDiff.toggle(0)\n  vim.cmd(\"redraw\")\nend, { desc = \"Toggle Mini Diff\" })\n```",
